#
# The `guardrail approval` workflow reads this list with
# tools/guarded_paths.py: a pull request that touches one of these waits for
# the operator's approval of the `guardrail` environment. That script reads a
# subset of the CODEOWNERS format and fails on the rest: no wildcards, no
# negations, a leading slash for any path with a slash in it, and an owner on
# every line (a line without one would remove ownership).

